  "segments": [
    {
      "line": 1,
      "text": "1.前往亚诺曼城绅斯的家（150.87）与艾莉亚（14.14）对话，选“是”获得【少女的嘱托】。",
      "type": "item-acquisition",
      "sourceLines": [
        1
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 2,
      "text": "2夜晚，前往奇利村与神秘少女莉卡（74.68）对话，选“是”进入战斗。",
      "type": "timed-battle-step",
      "sourceLines": [
        2
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 3,
      "text": "◆战斗信息：",
      "type": "battle-heading",
      "sourceLines": [
        3
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 4,
      "text": "Lv.45神秘少女莉卡，血量约7000；技能：攻击、搅乱攻击、气功弹、战栗袭心、明镜止水",
      "type": "battle-enemy",
      "sourceLines": [
        4
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 5,
      "text": "Lv.40黄金树精*2，血量约4500；技能：攻击、防御、气功弹、阳炎",
      "type": "battle-enemy",
      "sourceLines": [
        5
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 6,
      "text": "3.战斗胜利后传送至？？？，与神秘少女莉卡对话，交出【少女的嘱托】获得【证明信】并传送出？？？。",
      "type": "exchange-step",
      "sourceLines": [
        6
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 7,
      "text": "4.白天，前往乌克兰村与神秘仙人（64.18）对话，选“是”进入战斗。",
      "type": "timed-battle-step",
      "sourceLines": [
        7
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 8,
      "text": "◆战斗信息：",
      "type": "battle-heading",
      "sourceLines": [
        8
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 9,
      "text": "Lv.50神秘仙人，血量约8000，技能：连击、诸刃、崩击",
      "type": "battle-enemy",
      "sourceLines": [
        9
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 10,
      "text": "Lv.45神秘鼠（鼠王）*2，血量约5500，技能：攻击、乾坤、阳炎",
      "type": "battle-enemy",
      "sourceLines": [
        10
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 11,
      "text": "5.战斗胜利后传送至？？？，与神秘仙人对话，交出【证明信】获得【黄金粽子】并传送出？？？。",
      "type": "exchange-step",
      "sourceLines": [
        11
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 12,
      "text": "6.返回亚诺曼城绅斯的家，与艾莉亚对话，交出【黄金粽子】获得【艾莉亚的项链】、【端午香包】，任务结束。",
      "type": "versioned-completion",
      "sourceLines": [
        12
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 13,
      "text": "◆【艾莉亚的项链】（2018年）：",
      "type": "version-heading",
      "sourceLines": [
        13
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 14,
      "text": "Lv.3项链、耐久200；攻击+15、敏捷+12、必杀+6、命中+6、生命+150、毒+12~15、石化+12~15、混乱+12~15；",
      "type": "reward-detail",
      "sourceLines": [
        14
